<title>BELGIUM: MOTOR RACING-BELGIAN GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-BELGIAN GRAND PRIX GRID POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>SPA-FRANCORCHAMPS, Belgium 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
